{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，flavor='seurat_v3' 时高变基因选择期望的是计数数据，而不是对数化数据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Expects logarithmized data, except when `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'`, in which count data is expected."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是 raw_integer_counts，符合 seurat_v3 对计数输入的期望，因此可以直接作为输入。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "seurat_v3 的计算流程是先对每个基因做带正则化标准差的 z-score 标准化，再计算标准化后方差并按该方差对基因排序。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "For `flavor='seurat_v3'`/`'seurat_v3_paper'` :cite:p:`Stuart2019`, a normalized variance for each gene\n    is computed. First, the data are standardized (i.e., z-score normalization\n    per feature) with a regularized standard deviation. Next, the normalized variance\n    is computed as the variance of each gene after the transformation. Genes are ranked\n    by the normalized variance."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在 flavor='seurat_v3' 下，n_top_genes 是必须提供的参数；你已提供 n_top_genes=2000，因此该条件已满足。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "n_top_genes\n        Number of highly-variable genes to keep. Mandatory if `flavor='seurat_v3'`."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 batch_key=null 表示未指定批次；在无批次时 seurat_v3 与 seurat_v3_paper 的排序差异不适用，因此不需要额外批次处理。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:batch_key"]
    },
    {
      "text": "必要的下一步是确认 AnnData 对象已正确装载该原始整数计数矩阵，并显式传入 flavor='seurat_v3' 与 n_top_genes=2000 调用 highly_variable_genes。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
